    "title": "Daily life on the waterfront",
    "p1": "The port and corniche show Al Hoceima as a working coastal town: fishing boats, evening walkers and simple restaurants facing the Mediterranean.",
    "p2": "It is not a monumental harbour — come for atmosphere, a stroll after the beach and grilled fish near the water.",
    "p3": "Sunset and early evening are the liveliest times. Combine with Quemado Beach for a full town-and-bay day."
